{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"636017934723973133","content":"The tavern door slams open as handful of raucous, drunken figures make a noisy entrance.\n    \"Pub craaaawwwwwll\" yells one of the revelers, a large man with the features and build of hippo but walking on two legs. \"I ain't leavin for the new world without a taste of every drink in London. C'mon comrades next one's for Izzy and her pockets as deep as the Spanish sea!!\" He bellows cheerfully and pushes a few patrons aside as he disturbs their otherwise peaceful meal. \"Barkeep! A round for the flock before we sail off the ends of the world! Huh Huh.\" He elbows a shorter but slender individual with a hard metal skin and joints of what looks like rich brown heartwood of walnut.\n\"I do not want a drink. I've informed you many times sir. I can not drink... physically.\" The warforged seems to almost sigh but without exhaling. It is not inherent to my design.\"\n\"Not built out off the strong stuff, eh, Petra?\" the hippo-ish man replies. \"Not many are built like ole' Griff! No one beats a Griff the Giff in a trial of cups!! Kairo, next ones' on you and by you, I mean little mizzy Izzy! Olay!\"\nA handsome tabaxi with shiny, shimmering fur, slinks up to the table from behind them and nods at the barkeep as he lays down enough coin to buy the bar. The tabaxi simply says \"Keep em coming.\" and takes a stool at the bar. A few others trail in behind them, talking amongst themselves but not nearly as deep in their cups as Griff.","created_at":"2020-07-18T23:39:30.152000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734192657349345350","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
